UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Danville, Pennsylvania, Auto Weld Chassis and Components has over 40 years of engineering and manufacturing experience in the racing and street performance industry. The company designs and fabricates premium chassis systems and custom suspensions for race cars, pro street builds, and street rods.

The shop produces a complete line of mandrel-bent frame rails, chassis kits, housings, and suspension components, including 4-link and ladder bar suspensions, front-end assemblies, and Featherweight OEM front suspensions. Auto Weld is vertically integrated, with most products manufactured in-house, allowing for a wide variety of custom specifications. Every part is crafted from top-grade materials by skilled technicians familiar with the extreme demands of competitive motorsports.

The company serves a worldwide customer base in drag racing, street performance, and classic car markets. Its race-tested designs have powered numerous drag racing winners and award-winning street-legal vehicles featured at NHRA and other national events.

Auto Weld emphasizes American-made quality and competitive pricing, adjusting for material cost fluctuations. The vertical integration model ensures higher quality control and the ability to meet custom specifications, which the company cites as key differentiators from competitors. Products are tested on both street and track, and have been featured in magazines and on television.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Mandrel bending", "Chassis fabrication", "Custom suspension fabrication", "4-link suspension fabrication", "Ladder bar suspension fabrication", "Front-end assembly fabrication", "Featherweight OEM front suspension fabrication", "Chassis kit assembly", "Housing fabrication", "Vertical integration (in-house manufacturing)", "Custom specification engineering"], "industries": ["Drag racing", "Street performance", "Street rods", "Pro street", "Classic cars", "Motorsports"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated with most products manufactured in-house", "Race-tested designs proven at NHRA and national events", "American-made performance chassis and suspension systems", "Custom specifications enabled by in-house manufacturing", "Competitive pricing on chassis and suspension products"], "facts_used": ["Location: Danville, Pennsylvania -> db", "Over 40 years engineering and manufacturing experience -> /about-us", "Manufacturer of Race Car, Pro Street and Street Rod chassis & components -> /about-us", "Products: mandrel-bent frame rails, chassis kits, housings, suspension components -> /", "Suspension types: 4-link, ladder bar, front-end assemblies, Featherweight OEM front suspensions -> /", "Vertically integrated, most products manufactured in-house -> /about-us", "Custom specifications available due to in-house manufacturing -> /about-us", "Race-tested designs powered drag racing winners and award-winning street legal cars at NHRA events -> /", "Worldwide