UPDATE companies SET description='AutoPort, Inc. was founded in 1981 as a privately held company in New Castle, Delaware. The firm operates on more than 100 acres adjacent to the Port of Wilmington, with 90,000 square feet of covered space and an on-site rail head capable of handling 72 multi-level rail cars daily.

