UPDATE companies SET description='Automation Components Inc (ACI) has been manufacturing building automation sensors in Middleton, Wisconsin, since 1991. The company employs over 200 people across four facilities in Middleton, where it engineers, designs, and produces its sensor lines.

ACI’s product portfolio spans temperature, humidity, pressure, current, gas, interface, wireless, BACnet/Modbus, air quality, and power metering sensors. Temperature sensors are double encapsulated for durability; humidity sensors carry a five-year warranty and are field calibratable. The company builds thousands of custom sensors daily, offering variations in probe length, wire type, fittings, private branding, and packaging.

The sensors serve building automation, HVAC, data center, refrigeration, air handling, chiller, and indoor air quality applications.

ACI differentiates itself through ISO 9001:2015 certification, domestic manufacturing, and a service model that includes live technical support via phone, email, chat, or video conference, consistent fast shipping, and no minimum order requirements. The company states that its culture of empowered, long-term employees drives both product innovation and philanthropic initiatives.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','RoHS','UL/CUL US Listed (UL 916)','CE','UKCA','WEEE','CAN ICES-3 / NMB-3','BTL Certified (BACnet sensors)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Temperature sensor manufacturing", "Humidity sensor manufacturing", "Pressure sensor manufacturing (wet and dry media)", "Current sensor manufacturing (switches, transmitters, relays)", "Gas sensor manufacturing (CO2, toxic, combustible, refrigerant leak detection)", "Interface device manufacturing (signal conversion)", "Wireless sensor systems (MESHNET 900 MHz spread spectrum)", "BACnet/Modbus communicating sensors (BTL certified)", "Air quality sensor manufacturing (VOC, PM, CO2, temperature, humidity)", "Power metering solutions", "Custom sensor manufacturing (probe lengths, wire length/type, fittings, private branding, custom packaging)", "Technical support (application and product challenges)", "Field calibration (humidity sensors)", "Double encapsulation (temperature sensors)"], "industries": ["Building automation", "HVAC", "Data centers", "Refrigeration systems", "Air handling units", "Chiller systems", "Indoor air quality (IAQ)", "Energy management"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["ISO 9001:2015 certified manufacturing", "Four Middleton, WI facilities producing American-made sensors", "Custom sensor configurations (probe length, wire, fittings, branding, packaging)", "Live technical support by phone, email, chat, or video conference", "No minimum order quantity"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1991 in Middleton, WI -> db and /", "200+ employee