UPDATE companies SET description='Backwoods Custom LLC is a custom cabinetry shop based in Phoenix, Arizona. The company designs, builds, and installs cabinetry for residential projects across the state.

The shop produces custom kitchens, built‑ins, closets, specialty woodwork, barn doors, French doors, and shelving. Each project moves through a four‑step process: consultation, 3D design and rendering, precision CNC cutting and skilled woodworking, and professional installation. The company emphasizes combining digital design with CNC equipment to achieve accurate fit and finish before assembly.

Backwoods Custom serves homeowners throughout Arizona, delivering projects such as kitchen remodels, entertainment centers, home offices, walk‑in closets, and one‑of‑a‑kind woodworking pieces.

The company positions itself on a "built different" philosophy: no one‑size‑fits‑all cabinets, every piece designed for the specific space, locally crafted in Phoenix with quality materials, and backed by a licensed, bonded, and insured operation (ROC #352389). Attention to detail from design through final installation is cited as the primary differentiator.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom Cabinetry", "Custom Kitchens", "Built-Ins", "Custom Closets", "Specialty Woodwork", "Custom Shelving", "Barn Doors", "French Doors", "CNC Cutting"], "industries": ["Residential cabinetry", "Home remodeling", "Custom woodworking"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["CNC cutting equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Every project custom\u2011designed and built for the specific space \u2014 no stock cabinets", "Locally manufactured in Phoenix, Arizona with quality materials and skilled workmanship", "Detailed 3D design paired with precision CNC cutting for accurate fit", "Licensed, bonded, and insured (Arizona ROC #352389)", "Full\u2011service flow from consultation through design, build, and installation"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Phoenix, Arizona -> db", "Company name: Backwoods Custom -> db", "Capabilities list: Custom Cabinetry, Custom Kitchens, Built-Ins, Custom Closets, Specialty Woodwork, Custom Shelving, Barn Doors, French Doors, CNC Cutting -> db", "Services described: Custom Kitchens, Built-Ins, Custom Closets, Specialty Woodwork, Custom Shelving, Barn Doors, French Doors -> /services", "Process steps: Consultation, Design (3D rendering), Build (CNC cutting, woodworking), Installation -> /", "Licensed, bonded, insured with ROC #352389 -> /", "Serves homes throughout Arizona -> /about", "Locally built in Phoenix with quality materials and skilled workmanship -> /", "Precision CNC cutting combined with 3D design -> /", "No one-size-fits-all cabinets; every project designed for the specific space -> 