UPDATE companies SET description='Baker Medical, Inc. operates as a locally owned medical supply retailer in Conway, Arkansas, with a second location in Clinton. The company has served the state for nearly two decades, though a precise founding year is not published.

The business stocks and ships a range of home healthcare products, including CPAP and BiPAP systems, catheters, incontinence supplies, diabetic and insulin pump accessories, and oral supplements. A respiratory therapist on staff performs daily CPAP setups, and the company runs a resupply program that mails fresh consumables to patients’ doors. Orders over $20 ship free via USPS, with processing within one business day and delivery in one to three days anywhere in Arkansas.

The company bills most insurance plans with a valid prescription, positioning itself as an intermediary between prescribers, payers, and end users.

Baker Medical emphasizes its clinical support—particularly the respiratory therapist-led CPAP setups—and its Arkansas-focused logistics as key differentiators. The ownership describes the mission as improving patients’ quality of life through accessible equipment and responsive service.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Medical equipment retail and distribution", "CPAP/BiPAP setup and therapy support", "Resupply program management", "Insurance billing and claims processing", "Respiratory therapy consultation", "Catheter and incontinence supply provision", "Diabetic and insulin pump supply provision"], "industries": ["Medical supplies", "Home healthcare", "Respiratory care", "Diabetes care", "Urology care", "Durable medical equipment"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Orders processed within 24 hours; delivery in 1\u20133 business days within Arkansas", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Free shipping on orders over $20 within Arkansas", "Orders processed within 24 hours, delivered in 1\u20133 business days", "Respiratory therapist conducts daily CPAP/BiPAP setups", "Resupply program mails fresh supplies directly to patients", "Bills most insurance plans with a valid prescription"], "facts_used": ["Locally-owned medical supply store in Conway, Arkansas -> /", "Serving Arkansas for nearly two decades -> /about", "Offers CPAP/BiPAP supplies, catheters, incontinence, diabetic, insulin pump, oral supplements -> /services", "Respiratory therapist conducts daily CPAP setups -> /services", "Resupply program mails fresh supplies to patients -> /services", "Free shipping on orders over $20 via USPS, processed within 24 hours, delivered 1-3 days -> /", "Two locations: Conway and Clinton, Arkansas -> /", "Bills most insurances with valid prescription -> /services"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "is a locally-owned and operated medical supply store based in Conway, Arkansas", "founded_