UPDATE companies SET description='Barku Plastics operates from Cleveland, Tennessee. The company traces its roots to 1977 when Egon Schumacher founded it as a subsidiary of LUBING Maschinenfabrik GmbH in Germany. Barku Plastics L.L.C. was established in Cleveland in September 2003 as a subsidiary of Barku Kunststofftechnik GmbH, maintaining German ownership.

The company specializes in custom plastic injection molding and profile extrusion. It runs more than 50 injection molding machines ranging from 32 to 1,100 tons, and over 10 extrusion lines capable of diameters up to 6 inches and profile widths up to 39 3/8 inches. Processes include two-component and insert molding, as well as co-extrusion for multi-material products. The facility operates three shifts and processes more than 14,000 tons of raw material annually. Materials processed include PP, PE, PS, PVC, POM, ABS, PU, and PA. Barku also provides assembly services, engineering support, mold development, and packaging of multi-part assemblies.

Barku serves customers worldwide across various industries, though specific sectors are not named in the input. The company works with clients needing precision injection-molded parts and extruded profiles and pipes, offering development, design, series production, and further processing.

Barku emphasizes flexibility, know-how, and a commitment to high quality standards, reflected in its ISO 9001:2015 certification with TUV Rheinland. The company highlights its partnerships with mold builders on three continents and continuous optimization of production processes through machine park renewal and employee training.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom plastic injection molding", "Profile extrusion", "Two-component molding", "Insert molding", "Co-extrusion", "Mold design and development", "Assembly services", "Engineering support", "Multi-part assembly", "Packaging"], "industries": [], "materials": ["PP", "PE", "PS", "PVC", "POM", "ABS", "PU", "PA"], "equipment": ["50+ injection molding machines (32\u20131,100 ton)", "10+ extrusion lines"], "volume": "Small to large series; over 14,000 tons of raw material annually", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Partnerships with mold builders on three continents", "50+ injection molding machines (32\u20131,100 ton range)", "10+ extrusion lines with co-extrusion capability", "ISO 9001:2015 certified by TUV Rheinland", "Three-shift operation processing >14,000 tons/year"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1977 by Egon Schumacher -> /about", "US entity established 2003 as subsidiary of Barku Kunststofftechnik GmbH -> /about", "Headquarters at 131 Corporate Drive SW, Cleveland, TN 37311 -> /, /about", "50+ injection molding machines (32\u20131,100 ton) -> /", "10+ extrusion lines, diameters up to 6\", profile widths up to 39 3/8\" -> /", "Materials: PP, PE, PS, PVC, POM, ABS, PU, PA -> /", "Two-component and insert molding technology -> /", "Co-extrusion process for multi-material products -> /", "ISO 9001:2015 certified with TUV Rheinland -> /about", "Processes >14,000 tons raw material per year -> /about", "Three-shift operation -> /about", "Assembly services, engineering support, mold development, packaging -> /about", "Partnerships with mold builders on three c