UPDATE companies SET description='Bassett Furniture operates a retail location in Meridian, Idaho, serving as a showroom for the company''s broader manufacturing operations. The brand''s BenchMade wood collections are produced in a factory in Virginia, while upholstered pieces are assembled in Newton, North Carolina, using both domestic and imported components. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not disclosed in the available store information.

