UPDATE companies SET description='Battlefield Fabrication operates from Searcy, Arkansas, serving White County and the surrounding Central Arkansas region. The company is a small, family-owned business that describes itself as a licensed and insured contractor specializing in metal-roofed buildings and portable structures. No founding year or founder names are disclosed in public materials.

