UPDATE companies SET description='Beltway Used Auto Parts LLC has operated from Hyattsville, Maryland since its founding in 1999. The limited‑liability company runs an environmentally focused auto recycling yard that supplies used components for late‑model foreign and domestic cars and light trucks.

The yard processes end‑of‑life vehicles and harvests parts ranging from wiring harnesses and bumper assemblies to diesel particulate filters and differential carriers. Inventory is tracked through a yard management system that updates stock daily, and the company uses Car‑Part Interchange to cross‑reference fitment.

Beltway ships via UPS, FedEx, and freight carriers, and runs its own delivery fleet six days a week to Maryland, Delaware, Virginia, the District of Columbia, and Pennsylvania. The company also purchases vehicles directly from sellers for recycling.

