UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Nitro, West Virginia, Rotech Healthcare operates as a national provider of home medical equipment and respiratory services. The company describes itself as a hometown company with the advantages of a national network, though its founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

Rotech supplies a range of home healthcare products including ventilators, oxygen systems, CPAP and sleep apnea devices, wound care solutions, diabetes management supplies, airway clearance equipment, nebulizers, and general home medical equipment. The company also runs clinical programs such as NIVnow for non‑invasive ventilation support, COPDBridge for reducing 30‑day readmissions, SleepWELL for CPAP compliance, Pediatric Vents, and an ALS program. Its team comprises respiratory clinicians, customer service representatives, Medicare and insurance experts, and patient service technicians who coordinate delivery, setup, and ongoing patient education.

The primary industry served is home medical equipment, with customers including individual patients, physicians, hospitals, and social workers. Testimonials on the company’s site reference patients in Kentucky, Texas, South Carolina, and North Carolina, as well as a social worker who notes reliable delivery by discharge date. Rotech partners with physicians to ensure successful treatment and works with facilities to coordinate vital services.

Rotech emphasizes its Joint Commission accreditation, held since 2000, as a mark of quality and safety. Its stated mission is to “Get it Right the First Time,” and core fundamentals stress teamwork, clinical and service excellence, and prioritizing patients and healthcare professionals. The company positions its differentiator as combining the feel of a local provider with the resources of a national organization.', certifications=ARRAY['Joint Commission Accreditation']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Home oxygen therapy", "Sleep apnea treatment (CPAP)", "Non\u2011invasive ventilation (NIV)", "Wound care solutions", "Diabetes management", "Airway clearance therapy", "Nebulizer therapy", "Home medical equipment supply", "Clinical program: NIVnow", "Clinical program: COPDBridge", "Clinical program: SleepWELL", "Clinical program: Pediatric Vents", "Clinical program: ALS Program", "Patient connected care", "Coordinate vital services", "Reduce 30\u2011day readmissions", "Increase CPAP compliance"], "industries": ["Home Medical Equipment", "Home Healthcare", "Respiratory Care", "Wound Care", "Diabetes Management", "Sleep Medicine"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Ventilators", "Oxygen systems", "CPAP machines", "Nebulizers", "Airway clearance devices"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Joint Commission Accredited since 2000", "National provider with hometown feel", "Clinical programs: NIVnow, COPDBridge, SleepWELL, Pediatric Vents, ALS Program", "Team of respiratory clinicians and Medicare experts", "Mission: Get it Right the First Time"], "facts_used": ["HQ city/state -> db", "Website -> db", "Joint Commission Accredited since 2000 -> /about-us", "Industries served: Home Medical Equipment -> db", "Product categories: ventilators, oxygen, sleep apnea treatment, wound care solutions, diabetes management, home medical equipment -> /about-us", "Clinical programs: NIVnow, COPDBridge, SleepWELL, Pediatric Vents, ALS Program -> /", "Team comp