UPDATE companies SET description='Big Frog Custom T-Shirts & More operates a retail garment decorating boutique at 3505 West 41st Street in Sioux Falls, South Dakota. The Big Frog brand was established in 2008 by co-founders Leeward Bean, Tina Bacon-DeFrece, and Ron DeFrece in Clearwater, Florida, and has since grown to nearly 100 locations nationwide. The Sioux Falls franchise was opened by Ryan and Ethan Corbin, who position the shop as a local partner invested in the community.

The facility specializes in direct-to-garment (DTG) printing with white ink, screen printing, embroidery, ultra print, direct-to-film, and vinyl decoration. It offers on-demand production with no minimum order quantities and no setup fees, and advertises a 24-hour turnaround on in-stock garments. The shop carries blank apparel from brands such as Alternative, Bella+Canvas, Gildan, Nike, Puma, Adidas, and Travis Matthews, and provides free in-person design assistance.

