UPDATE companies SET description='Based in Four Corners near Bozeman, Montana, Black Timber Furniture Company has been crafting solid-wood pieces for over a decade.

The workshop produces custom solid-wood furniture, live-edge tables, Murphy beds, and commercial-grade pieces using traditional joinery and hand-applied finishes. Each project moves through a collaborative design process where clients select wood species — such as alder, oak, walnut, maple, cherry, or reclaimed barn wood — along with hardware, leather, or fabric upholstery.

